  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"djRpG\" id=\"djRpG\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8133ab7a\" id=\"u8133ab7a\">学习目标</span></h2><ol list=\"u0e2f3cb1\"><li fid=\"ud94e1d70\" data-lake-id=\"u45a2ee8e\" id=\"u45a2ee8e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u46a62aef\" id=\"u46a62aef\">理解extern的作用</span></li><li fid=\"ud94e1d70\" data-lake-id=\"u4636e1f0\" id=\"u4636e1f0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc7f9ecbe\" id=\"uc7f9ecbe\">掌握extern的用法</span></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id=\"mpNEX\" id=\"mpNEX\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf11c285a\" id=\"uf11c285a\">学习内容</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"Hw6V8\" id=\"Hw6V8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b600c5b\" id=\"u9b600c5b\">extern理解</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u2f5ac182\" id=\"u2f5ac182\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucab50ab9\" id=\"ucab50ab9\">extern是C语言中的一个关键字，用于说明一个全局变量或函数的定义不在本文件中，而在其他文件中，告诉编译器该变量或函数已经在别的文件中定义过了。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud67feaba\" id=\"ud67feaba\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd0a0e05\" id=\"udd0a0e05\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ueb5022cb\" id=\"ueb5022cb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c629bcd\" id=\"u3c629bcd\">在C语言中，如果要在一个源文件中使用另一个源文件中定义的全局变量或函数，需要使用extern关键字声明一下该变量或函数，这样编译器才能知道该变量或函数已经在其他文件中定义过了。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"tsB1x\" id=\"tsB1x\"><span data-lake-id=\"u39b8f919\" id=\"u39b8f919\">extern变量</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uee48614a\" id=\"uee48614a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6d887313\" id=\"u6d887313\">以下是extern关键字的用法和示例：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6b9cc6ce\" id=\"u6b9cc6ce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u28a1d1ba\" id=\"u28a1d1ba\">在一个源文件中定义全局变量，然后在另一个源文件中使用该变量：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22driver.c%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20global_var%20%3D%2010%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22driver.c%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TqThv%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22main.c%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnextern%20int%20global_var%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnint%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20global_var)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%5Ctreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22main.c%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dLnL4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"NhQPs\" id=\"NhQPs\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue0028d22\" id=\"ue0028d22\">extern函数</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ub347205c\" id=\"ub347205c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub66200bc\" id=\"ub66200bc\">在一个源文件中定义函数，然后在另一个源文件中使用该函数：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22driver.c%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%20%7B%5Cn%5Ctreturn%20a%20%2B%20b%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22driver.c%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hbfl7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u62a040d7\" id=\"u62a040d7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u38e40acb\" id=\"u38e40acb\">​</span><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22main.c%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22extern%20int%20add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnint%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20result%20%3D%20add(1%2C%202)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20result)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22main.c%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OBP1Q%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"bTsi5\" id=\"bTsi5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua591da71\" id=\"ua591da71\">头文件中定义</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uf8dd56bf\" id=\"uf8dd56bf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1aeac36f\" id=\"u1aeac36f\">需要注意的是，如果在一个源文件中定义了一个全局变量或函数，并且该变量或函数要在多个源文件中使用，那么需要将该变量或函数的定义放在一个头文件中，并在其他源文件中包含该头文件。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf6dfb149\" id=\"uf6dfb149\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaca4b7e0\" id=\"uaca4b7e0\">例如，将上面的</span><code data-lake-id=\"u6f22ae39\" id=\"u6f22ae39\"><span data-lake-id=\"u40bdb340\" id=\"u40bdb340\">global_var</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub56a96e0\" id=\"ub56a96e0\">和</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua532fe78\" id=\"ua532fe78\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua1e7e36a\" id=\"ua1e7e36a\">add</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u20133d00\" id=\"u20133d00\">函数的定义放在一个头文件中：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5b105071\" id=\"u5b105071\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue2be8644\" id=\"ue2be8644\">​</span><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22myheader.h%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22extern%20int%20global_var%3B%5Cnextern%20int%20add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22myheader.h%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OrHWz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uacc17008\" id=\"uacc17008\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u97313eed\" id=\"u97313eed\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2e1bf2e7\" id=\"u2e1bf2e7\">然后在其他源文件中包含该头文件即可使用该变量和函数：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22myimpl.c%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20myimpl.c%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22myheader.h%5C%22%5Cn%5Cnint%20global_var%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cn%5Cnint%20add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20a%20%2B%20b%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22myimpl.c%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bHuhv%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22test.c%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20test.c%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22myheader.h%5C%22%5Cnint%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20global_var)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20result%20%3D%20add(1%2C%202)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20result)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22test.c%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XcNsl%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u33967767\" id=\"u33967767\"><br></p>",
